Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Still planning fence lines\Non a legal pad
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and building quotes by hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.72,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,With PostPlotter,\Ntype in the address,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,pull up the real\Nsatellite photo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.26,0:00:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,pick your materials,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and draw the fence line\Nright on the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Set your prices once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,From then on,\Nevery job lists your materials
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and prices itself with you\Nin control of all your projects.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,One tap sends your customer\Na real branded quote
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,they can open\Nright on their phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No app, no login.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment they tap accept,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you're notified,\Nwith their number ready to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan it, price it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.79,0:00:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,send it, get it scheduled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's PostPlotter,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,try it free at postplotter.com.
